@startuml credit-reservation-state
title Credit Reservation — Canonical V1 Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> ACTIVE : establish protected credit
ACTIVE --> CONSUMED : convert to Receivable
ACTIVE --> RELEASED : terminal commercial result
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : validity expires
CONSUMED --> [*]
RELEASED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]

note right of ACTIVE
Available Credit subtracts active reservations once.
Receivable posting at confirmed SalesOrder transfers
the exposure without double counting.
end note
@enduml
